{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-05_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-05",
  "title": "Who to Kill?",
  "storyCode": "6-5",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ccd8d485ad8f95f697acde64637d5d2c170e2bb1901c506ef35ca9f1898f80d8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）\nMeanwhile, on the other side of the slums..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Calm down! Say it again slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "B- but... all of them... they're all dead!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What's happening? What happened? I can't see! I can't see anything!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Say again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Report!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "...phew."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Who's there?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "...that smell. Don't panic! Everyone's still here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Listen up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Aaah! It's red! I saw it! I saw the red!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Calm him down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "... (Inhuman laughing)."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I... I want to go home... I want to go back to Ursus..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "There's ghosts here! And monsters! I saw the shadows... of two women!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Aaaaaagh! I want to go home!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We shouldn't have come, Crownslayer!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Do you copy? Answer me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "The layout of these slums is confusing, but don't let the enemy confuse you. We are perfectly safe!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "(How is our position still exposed with all the fog?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "There remains the traitor's position. I am aware."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "She is in Lungmen. Kill her. Make a name for yourself that your enemies should fear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "After you've killed your rival, then what? Don't forget your true enemy."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "——Who?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Bring her to me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Sorry, Swire, bring you who?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Bring her to me!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Erm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "(Who is she talking about?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(I don't know, maybe...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "That pink-haired sewer scum! Dial 100800-00200-rct211-93001! That's her number!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "(How did she memorize a number that long?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(That number is familiar... Is it that one lady...?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "What are you two whispering about?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "What are you up to, you filthy rat?! What have you done?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "And why do you suspect me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "I'm glad it wasn't you. Phew. You had me worried there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Suspect you of what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "If you're talking about the special forces, that was me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Lin Yühsia, I think I misheard something. I misheard you, didn't I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "The L. G. D. has its business, and we have ours."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Wei Yenwu has you to keep order in Lungmen, and we are here to remove that which Lungmen does not need."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "You know what this team did in the slums?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "They helped you deal with Reunion quite efficiently."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "That buffer zone was your father's blood, sweat, and tears!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "It's all thanks to him and his work in the slums that Lungmen is what it is today!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Do you know their objective?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "You've made it very clear. The slums are full of places for Reunion to hide, not to mention their invasion route. You'd level them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Isn't that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "We're working with Rhodes Island now. Reunion is no match for us! You don't have to do this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Jumping to conclusions before I even have a chance to explain..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "While Reunion is certainly no match for us, they're still not a problem for civilian forces to solve."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We must use the true power of our city to eradicate this threat. This is how I face the invaders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Why can't you put your faith in Rhodes Island and our own L. G. D.?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Why should we trust Rhodes Island? And why dirty the hands of the L. G. D.?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "What do you mean dirty...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Don't tell me you had no other choice. That's your father's land."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "It takes so much more to build than to destroy!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Breaking a pane of glass takes one person one second... Do you know how long it takes to make one? How many people are involved?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Swire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Do you know what it is the people fear? Do you know what it is that scares the chambers of commerce?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "What's wrong with you? Aren't we facing off against Reunion?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You really don't understand at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Fine. Filthy rat... I don't understand. Might I humble myself and request that you grace me with an explanation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "The Infected... are growing in number. The people fear the Infected, and they don't care if they're Reunion or not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "In short, don't go looking in the sewers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "Hello? Are you there?! Stinking, shit-eating rat!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "You dare hang up on me! Sei puk gaai syu ah! How dare you hang up on me?!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_036",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_036",
      "text": "Ch'en chased off the Black Cloaks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_036",
      "text": "What to do about that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_036",
      "text": "They'll move past her, and accelerate the pace. Hm, that will do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_036",
      "text": "Dad, if you were me, if the younger you were me, this is what you'd do too, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_036",
      "text": "...What am I doing...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "What do you mean? That's impossible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "text": "Your herd is shrinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "text": "The initial attack was ferocious and terrifying, but... We're not really sure why, but our scouts report their numbers aren't growing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "text": "Unfortunately, the group that suffered the most from this tactic was the Reunion squad that sustained the initial attack."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Who? Who did this? The L. G. D.? The L. G. D. could never suppress my herd!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "text": "But our people..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "I took the L. G. D.'s tactics and equipment into consideration. Facing my herd should have delayed them at least two days. So who is it that's done this?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "People in black raincoats."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "text": "Captain!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Faust!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "Crossbowmen, reform the squad! Mine and a few other teams have scooped up a lot of Mephisto's people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "text": "...Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "Together, we can hold back the L. G. D."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Faust, Faust... are you hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "(Why did you leave back there?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "...Because I had to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "And I'm glad to see how many of our people you've brought back with you. You'll put them to good use against the L. G. D. I'm sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "They won't attack us, but I can't control them. I've been wracking my brain over it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "There aren't many left though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "We will need more of our people to protect us. We must defeat those L. G. D.s if we're going to escape."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Hm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "Mephisto, don't use those Arts again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "But didn't you say we have to survive, Faust? Isn't that what's most important?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "...Then why did you...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "Why did you say you would die for that monster, back at the L. G. D. Headquarters?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "Crossbowmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "text": "Ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "Take him."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
